# Captured evidence bytes are retained exactly as produced (SSE streams end in
# the blank line that terminates their last event; captured stdout/stderr logs
# end however the producing command ended them). Their SHA-256 values are
# pinned in the per-run MANIFEST.sha256 files, so they must not be whitespace-
# normalised. Exempt only these captured byte classes from the whitespace
# check; authored files in this folder keep the default rules.
*.sse -whitespace
*.log -whitespace
